  "assumptions": [
   "About 350 per arm (about 1,050 total) gives an MDE of about 0.03 at 80% power with SD 0.13, matching the observed Automated Flagging effect of +0.032 raw.",
   "Recruitment is stratified into ai_scale terciles using the screener; the interaction tests are underpowered.",
   "The instrument shows 4 posts for brevity; the fielded version would use 12 (6 images, 6 videos, half AI-generated). Label correctness is set so that exactly 95% or 70% of labels are right.",
   "A US online panel is used; compensation follows panel norms for a 10-minute survey."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "The research team must supply the image and video files and the label overlays.",
   "IRB approval number and participant compensation must be supplied.",
   "The panel's ability to stratify on ai_scale before randomisation must be confirmed."
